### Users — template base (UniversalController + rota extra)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken =
@userId =

### Listar com paginação (ADMIN / SYSTEM_ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Listar todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Buscar por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Criar usuário
### Ajuste role/status ao enum Prisma (ex.: ADMIN, USER, SYSTEM_ADMIN, …)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Usuário Teste",
  "email": "usuario.teste@exemplo.com",
  "password": "SenhaSegura1@",
  "role": "USER",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Atualizar usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "phone": "11999998888"
}

### Desativar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reativar
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Busca por nome
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/search/name?name=Teste
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Métricas (Universal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
